  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in comfort and spirit with the Personalized Southwestern Quilt Set by Jeminise. Featuring a striking realistic illustration of a wolf head adorned with a geometric headdress, feathers, and Native American inspired design motifs, this quilt brings both warmth and distinctive rustic charm to any bedroom setting.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features a custom text option to add your name or personalized requests directly onto the quilt.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>High-Quality Print:</strong> Made from a soft, lightweight, and breathable polyester-cotton blend that keeps you cozy in the winter and comfortable in the summer.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor bed layering, lounging on the sofa, or outdoor activities like camping and picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Available in versatile bedding sizes including Throw, Twin, Full, Queen, and King to fit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optional Components:</strong> Complete your bedding ensemble with optional matching pillowcases (available as a set of 2).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; quick-drying fabric fluffs up beautifully after air drying.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Cotton, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Indian Wolf</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Western</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Native American inspired</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Native</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt, 2 pillow covers (optional)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
